Type: Package
Title: Shock-Aware Input-Output Aggregation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Package", "Authors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Computes exact input-output aggregation bias and searches for low
    expected squared bias partitions using multistart greedy local search.
    Supports shock moments, hard constraints, priorities and sector-count frontiers.
